nearby devices to find, connect to and determine the relative position of nearby devices by using Bluetooth.<br>\u25cb Notifications: App accesses notification to send notification to users.<br>\u25cb Phone: App accesses user\u2019s phone to allow users to make phone calls on the app<br>\u25cb Photos and videos: App accesses photos and videos to allow users to view photos and videos on the app.<br>\u25cb Physical activity: App accesses physical activities to calculate and detect driving events, such as driving speed, use of breaks, and accident detection. <br><br>You may still use the app even if you withhold optional permissions. However, app features requiring permission may not be available in such case.",
